<title>USA: Donnkenny Q4 loss after charge.</title>
<headline>Donnkenny Q4 loss after charge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Net shr (loss)  $0.59	 (profit) $0.38</p>
<p> Net (loss)	8,288	 (profit) 5,247</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   14,012,116	     13,910,342</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company said it undertook a program during the fourth quarter of the 1996 fiscal year to reduce excess inventories, and as a result, it recorded inventory markdowns of $11.4 million.</p>
<p>The company said results of the year also reflect the effects of about $5.1 million related to sales returns and allowances as well as charges of $4.2 million related to one-time fees and expenses.</p>
</text>
